            "Trying to kill a thread: there is no API for it. Use an `Event`",
            "Using threads to speed up pure-Python CPU work",
            "Using daemon=True for work that must finish, like writes"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
